Subject: [PATCH 05/46] =?UTF-8?q?camera:=20unwrap=20four=20`do=20{=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=A6=20}=20while=20(0);`=20and=20two=20same-line-to-match?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20statements?=
